From: Scott K Logan <logans@cottsay.net>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 18:37:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Skip unnecessary RPATHs in RPM builds

---
 rpm/ros-lyrical-ompl.spec | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/rpm/ros-lyrical-ompl.spec b/rpm/ros-lyrical-ompl.spec
index 5a4f5e31c26d..42f0708da43a 100644
--- a/rpm/ros-lyrical-ompl.spec
+++ b/rpm/ros-lyrical-ompl.spec
@@ -60,6 +60,7 @@ OMPL is a free sampling-based motion planning library.
 %if !0%{?with_tests}
     -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF \
 %endif
+    -DOMPL_SKIP_RPATH=ON \
 
 %cmake3_build
 
